{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Agent playbook",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/duketopceo/Pace-Server/blob/main/docs/AGENT_DIAGNOSTICS.md",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Auth Health (detail)",
      "type": "dashboard",
      "uid": "pace-auth-health"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Agent quick read",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Pace — Onboarding & Auth (for agents)\n\n| Symptom | First check | GlitchTip event |\n|---|---|---|\n| Login 404 / Stytch init fails | CF Pages `VITE_STYTCH_PUBLIC_TOKEN` | `login.stytch_token_invalid` |\n| Post-login loop | JWT missing `tenant_id` | `auth.post_auth_route`, `auth.session_missing_tenant_id` |\n| Checkout won't start | Railway `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` + price IDs | `onboarding.checkout.failed`, `platform.diagnostics_blocker` |\n| Paid but no entitlements | Stripe webhook → `relay.pacehq.io` | `onboarding.blocked` |\n\n**In-app:** Settings → Platform diagnostics (verdict + `agentHint` per row).\n\n**Docs:** `docs/AGENT_DIAGNOSTICS.md`"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Checkout attempts (rate)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(strut_billing_checkout_total[5m])) by (outcome)",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Checkout failures by plan",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(strut_billing_checkout_total{outcome!=\"success\"}[5m])) by (plan, outcome)",
          "legendFormat": "{{plan}} — {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Checkout outcomes (instant)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(strut_billing_checkout_total) by (outcome)",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Auth failure rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(strut_auth_failures_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "strut failures/s"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(relay_auth_failures_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "relay failures/s"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Post-auth routing (GlitchTip proxy)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 13 },
      "description": "Search GlitchTip/Sentry for event auth.post_auth_route — not in Prometheus",
      "options": {
        "textMode": "name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Use GlitchTip: auth.post_auth_route"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Onboarding logs (Loki)",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{container_name=~\"pace-strut|pace-relay\"} |= \"onboarding\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Billing / Stripe logs (Loki)",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{container_name=~\"pace-strut|pace-relay\"} |~ \"billing|stripe|checkout\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Auth errors (Loki)",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{container_name=~\"pace-relay|pace-strut\"} |= \"auth\" |= \"failed\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Auth success vs failure",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 35 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(strut_auth_requests_total{status=\"success\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "strut success"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(strut_auth_failures_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "strut failures"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(relay_auth_requests_total{status=\"success\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "relay success"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(relay_auth_failures_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "relay failures"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }
    }
  ],
